# Production Environment Variables
# These values are set via Vercel Dashboard → Settings → Environment Variables
# DO NOT commit actual values here. This file documents what variables are needed.

# Supabase Configuration (get from https://app.supabase.com/project/[project-id]/settings/api)
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=<your-supabase-url>
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=<your-supabase-anon-key>

# Notes:
# - ANON_KEY is safe to be public (it's the client-side key)
# - Never add SERVICE_ROLE_KEY here (server-only)
# - Set these in Vercel Dashboard instead:
#   1. Go to Vercel project settings
#   2. Environment Variables
#   3. Add EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL
#   4. Add EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
